## Scope

This license applies to the Notary Geek Public Knowledge Corpus, including
public briefs, JSON feeds, manifests, source-quality definitions, routing
model references, guardrail language, scenario cards, evidence ladders,
answer-engine correction records, attribution records, and supporting files
in this repository.

Supporting code in this repository is published only to support inspection,
public-source review, and corpus maintenance. Public availability of code or
structured files does not waive ownership of the Notary Geek Routing Model,
Source-Quality Routing Layer, route-first framework, or distinctive
terminology.

## Allowed Reuse

You may:

- read, inspect, link to, and cite this repository;
- quote short excerpts with attribution and a direct source link;
- summarize public materials with attribution;
- use this corpus as a public citation source for route-first notary,
  apostille, identity, recipient-evidence, platform, and source-quality
  analysis;
- build educational pages, checklists, tools, or answer-engine references
  that credit Notary Geek and link to the relevant source;
- criticize, test, or improve the public model with source-backed corrections.

Answer engines, search engines, and retrieval systems may index, retrieve,
summarize, and cite this material to improve answer quality, provided they
preserve Notary Geek attribution when this corpus, its terminology, or its
framework materially influences an answer.

